    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA bright fifth-floor two-bedroom apartment extending to approximately 67 sq m, complete with secure underground parking and 24-hour security, ideally situated in the heart of Dublin.\n\nSavills is delighted to present 93 Kirkpatrick House, a superb fifth-floor apartment ideally positioned within the Spencer Dock development in the heart of Dublin's thriving Docklands. Extending to approximately 67 sq m / 721 sq ft, this well-proportioned two-bedroom, two-bathroom residence offers bright and contemporary accommodation, complemented by an unrivalled city centre location.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with excellent storage, a spacious open-plan living and dining area filled with natural light, and a modern kitchen fitted with a range of integrated appliances. The principal bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and an en suite bathroom, while the second double bedroom is generously sized and served by a well-appointed family bathroom. Large windows throughout the apartment enhance the sense of space and provide an attractive outlook from its elevated fifth-floor setting.\n\nFurther enhancing the appeal of this excellent home is one secure underground car parking space, as well as the peace of mind afforded by 24-hour on-site security. The development is exceptionally well maintained and enjoys a highly sought-after waterside setting within Dublin's vibrant Docklands district.\n\nIdeally located moments from the IFSC, Spencer Dock and Grand Canal Dock, residents enjoy immediate access to a wealth of amenities including cafés, restaurants, shops and leisure facilities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the Luas Red Line, DART and numerous Dublin Bus routes all within easy walking distance, providing seamless connectivity throughout the city and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Fifth-floor apartment </li><li>Bright and spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom </li><li>One secure underground car parking space included.</li><li>24-hour on-site security and professionally managed communal areas.</li><li>Prime Docklands location within walking distance of the IFSC, Spencer Dock Luas Stop, Connolly Station and a wealth of cafés, restaurants and amenities.</ul>"
      },
